  (text "B1 — PRECISION INPUTS: 8 x (1 k / 1 nF / BAV99 clamp) -> ADS8688 16-bit SAR ADC" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5b6d797d-7c4d-5d62-ab03-a3ed79ea7483"))
  (text "Input network per channel: 1 k series (limits clamp current to 36 mA at +-50 V), 1 nF to AGND (f-3dB ~160 kHz), BAV99 clamps to the +-12 V rails. ADC input +-10.24 V range, 1 MOhm input impedance, abs max +-20 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6bb52f37-8057-5116-8007-0ee956b210f9"))
  (text "ADS8688 decoupling per datasheet 11.1: AVDD 1 uF at each pin + 10 uF; REFCAP 1 uF + 22 uF (min 10 uF) direct at pins; REFIO 10 uF (internal 4.096 V ref, REFSEL low); DVDD 10 uF + 100 nF. DAISY = GND, RST/PD pulled to DVDD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "839c3506-f6ea-5517-9ebc-30c7415295f2"))
  (text "Channel mapping (firmware table, D-19): AI1->AIN_6, AI2->AIN_7, AI3->AIN_0, AI4->AIN_1, AI5->AIN_2, AI6->AIN_3, AI7->AIN_4, AI8->AIN_5 (package order = planar fan-in from the link, no crossings). AI7/AI8 switch to the OPT chain with JP101/JP102 (default: SMA path)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b9beff3d-e59d-535a-a45d-24c7904dd165"))
  (text "AGND = analog reference copper (L1/L4 pours), joined to GND only at NT1 (base). SDO has a 33 R source resistor." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c8c304ce-9167-53ed-9b3d-e07fd053ff18"))
  (text "8 identical input networks: 1 k -> node (1 nF to AGND, BAV99 clamps to the rails) -> AINn -> ADC channel per the D-19 table" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "656f7e8d-1081-5f57-89c9-48564cc35b56"))
  (text "REFSEL low = internal 4.096 V reference; REFCAP 1 uF + 22 uF, REFIO 10 uF (ADS8688 datasheet 8.3.3 / 11.1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 195 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9381dced-ab20-5f89-b122-c6a97ab68a9a"))
  (text "AVDD 1 uF at pins 9 and 30 + 10 uF bulk; DVDD 10 uF + 100 nF" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 200 60 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "95c96e81-f075-579a-b337-b1257a384f8d"))
  (text "RST/PD pulled up to DVDD (10k); firmware may pull it low for reset/power-down" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 290 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f1eb4a44-3f1b-5dda-aa8b-acd93c40483f"))
